#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "72_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Hrgh! Impressive, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "¡Hrgh! ¡Sorprendente, Kiryu!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Kiryu"
msgid "Looks like construction's keeping you in good shape. You're\\r\njust as strong as ever, Gary. So, you had your fill?"
msgstr "Parece que la construcción te mantiene en forma. Estás\\r \ntan fuerte como siempre, Gary. Entonces, ¿ya estás saciado?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "The only thing I'm filled with is more regret."
msgstr "Lo único de lo que estoy saciado es de arrepentimiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "But I'm glad we had the chance to fight again. Thank you,\\r\nKiryu-san."
msgstr "Pero me alegra haber tenido la oportunidad de pelearnos. \\r \nGracias, Kiryu."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Kiryu"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "No se preocupe."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Take this. Fight money for the champion."
msgstr "Toma. La recompensa para el campeón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_Kiryu"
msgid "Thanks. Take care of yourself, Gary."
msgstr "Gracias. Cuídate, Gary."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Same to you, Kiryu-san! Goodbye!"
msgstr "¡Lo mismo digo, Kiryu! ¡Adiós!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Kiryu"
msgid "(The noise is close now. I'm pretty high up...)"
msgstr "(El ruido es cercano. Estoy bastante arriba...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "240_Kiryu"
msgid "(Uh...)"
msgstr "(Eh...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Man in a Helmet"
msgid "Hrmph! Hrgh!"
msgstr "Hrmph! Hrgh!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey, you! What are you doing up here?"
msgstr "¡Oye, tú! ¿Qué haces aquí arriba?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Man in a Helmet"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "288_Kiryu"
msgid "Wait a second..."
msgstr "Un momento..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_Man in a Helmet"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Nice seeing you!"
msgstr "¡Oh, Kiryu! ¡Qué bueno verte de vuelta!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Kiryu"
msgid "Gary Buster Holmes. What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Gary Buster Holmes. ¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "324_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Don't you remember? I'm in bed with the Majima Family now!\\r\nAnyway, it's good seeing you!"
msgstr "¿No te acuerdas? ¡Ahora estoy atado a la Familia Majima!\\r \n¡De todas formas, qué bueno volverte a ver!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "336_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh right, sometimes I forget you're not with the Florist anymore."
msgstr "Ah sí, a veces me olvido que ya no estás con el Florista."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Yes, yes. I jumped rope and joined up after Majima took over\\r\nPurgatory."
msgstr "Sí, sí. Abandoné el 'banco' y me uní a Majima después de que\\r \néste tomara el Purgatorio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "360_Kiryu"
msgid "...I think you mean jumped ship."
msgstr "...Creo que te referías a que abandonaste el barco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Kiryu"
msgid "Either way, after seeing you at the Coliseum, the only\\r\nbuilding I ever thought I'd see you do is body building."
msgstr "Como sea, después de verte en el Coliseo, lo único que\\r\nme imaginaba verte construir son tus músculos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Kiryu"
msgid "(Though now that I think about it, it kinda looked like he was <Italic>busting</Italic> stuff up here...)"
msgstr "(Aunque ahora que lo pienso, más que construir parecía que \\r \nestuviera <Italic>destruyendo</Italic> cosas aquí arriba...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "So true! My life used to be nothing more than one big cycle\\r\nof pain and destruction!"
msgstr "¡Correcto! ¡Mi vida no era más que un gran ciclo de\\r\ndolor y destrucción!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "I'm kind of a musclehead, so I always thought fighting was\\r\nmy natural calling."
msgstr "Soy un poco 'musculitos', por lo que siempre pensé que\\r \nestaba destinado a la lucha."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Kiryu"
msgid "I know what you mean."
msgstr "Sé lo que quieres decir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "But once I started helping Majima, I learned I could use my\\r\nstrength to do more than just destroy. I could create, too!"
msgstr "Pero una vez empecé a ayudar a Majima, me di cuenta de que\\r \npodía usar mi fuerza para algo más que destruir. ¡Podía crear!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Building really is a wonderful thing. It might even be what\\r\nI was born to do."
msgstr "Realmente, construir es algo maravilloso. Puede que hasta\\r \nsea para lo que nací."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh. I have to say, your language skills have improved a\\r\nlot these past few years, too."
msgstr "Jé. Tengo que admitir que tu japonés ha mejorado muchísimo\\r \nestos últimos años."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "468_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Oh, yes! I study every day during my lunch break!"
msgstr "¡Sí! ¡Estudio cada día en mi descanso para comer!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Kiryu"
msgid "That's great, Gary. By the way, you should probably get some\\r\nrest. People are starting to think there's a ghost up here. Anyway, I'll see you around."
msgstr "Eso es genial, Gary. Por cierto, deberías descansar un poco.\\r \nAlgunos empiezan a creer que hay fantasmas aquí arriba. \\r\nBueno, nos vemos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "504_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Please hold on."
msgstr "Espera un momento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "¿Mm?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "I'm not a Coliseum fighter anymore... but I still have one\\r\nregret from my time in the ring."
msgstr "Ya no peleo en el Coliseo... pero todavía tengo una\\r \ncuenta pendiente de mi tiempo en el ring."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "That regret, Kiryu-san... is that I never defeated you."
msgstr "Esa cuenta pendiente, Kiryu... es que nunca te pude vencer."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "Oh."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "564_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Our meeting here tonight must be fate. Can we have a match?"
msgstr "Nuestro encuentro esta noche aquí debe ser el destino. \\r\n¿Podemos tener una pelea?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "576_Kiryu"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Eh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Kiryu"
msgid "If that's what you really want, yeah. I'll fight you."
msgstr "Si es lo que quieres, sí. Pelearé contigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_G. B. Holmes"
msgid "Just so you know, I'm not going to go easy on you. Now, do\\r\nyou prefer instant death or climax death?"
msgstr "Que sepas que no me voy a contener contigo. Dicho esto,\\r \n¿prefieres muerte instantánea o muerte clímax?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "612_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, same script as always. Sorry, but I don't want either!"
msgstr "Jé, siempre el mismo guión. ¡Lo siento, no elijo ninguna!"

